OL,5,G0225 Inside Art: Picasso/Ingres At the
OL,6,G     National Gallery
OL,7,     FTake a look at two portraits,
OL,8,     FPicasso's 'Woman with a Book' and
OL,9,     F'Madame Moitessier' by
OL,10,     FJean-Auguste-Dominique Ingres,
OL,11,     Fside by side, for the first time.
OL,12,G0250 Art Traffickers: Treasures Stolen
OL,13,G     from the Tombs
OL,14,     FThrough a combination of
OL,15,     Finterviews and studio
OL,16,     Freconstructions, recount the
OL,17,     Fgripping stories behind those who
OL,18,     Fhave excavated and stolen
OL,19,     Fmasterpieces. (2 of 4)
